  "body": "Nestled in the heart of Auckland's prestigious St Heliers neighbourhood, 18 Kaimata Street presents a rare opportunity to own a stunning three-storey duplex home in one of the city's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully maintained property boasts an enviable position, just a short stroll from the picturesque St Heliers Bay beachfront and the vibrant village centre. Residents will enjoy easy access to a wealth of local amenities, including top-performing schools, boutique shops, and an array of dining options.\r\n\r\nThe home itself is a true gem, offering spacious, light-filled living spaces and a well-appointed kitchen that opens to a wide balcony with sea views - the perfect setting for family gatherings and entertaining. With three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including 1 ensuite, and rumpus, there is ample room for growing families to enjoy the coastal ambiance.\r\n\r\nFeaturing an internal lift that provides access to all three levels, this duplex home offers unparalleled convenience and accessibility. The thoughtful design ensures a seamless flow between the living areas, bedrooms, and outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\n18 Kaimata Street is zoned for some of Auckland's most prestigious educational institutions, including the renowned St Heliers School and Glendowie College. This makes it an exceptional choice for families who value exceptional learning opportunities for their children.\r\n\r\nBeyond the immediate neighbourhood, the property enjoys convenient access to the Auckland city centre, ensuring a seamless lifestyle for busy professionals and commuters.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to call this exceptional property your new home. Contact us today to schedule a viewing and experience the unparalleled quality of life that 18 Kaimata Street, St Heliers has to offer.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
